+---
+title: Environment variables
+description: Canonical connection, reasoning, behavior and debug variables.
+---
+
+| Variable | Meaning |
+|---|---|
+| `EASY_AGENT_PROFILE` | Select a saved profile |
+| `EASY_AGENT_PROTOCOL` | Explicit temporary protocol: anthropic, openai-chat, openai-responses, gemini |
+| `EASY_AGENT_MODEL` | Upstream model of the temporary connection |
+| `EASY_AGENT_BASE_URL` | Optional address for that temporary connection |
+| `EASY_AGENT_API_KEY` | Its single API Key, or an explicitly referenced profile credential |
+| `EASY_AGENT_REASONING` | auto, on, off |
+| `EASY_AGENT_REASONING_BUDGET_TOKENS` | Positive integer reasoning budget |
+| `EASY_AGENT_MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS` | Context-window override |
+| `EASY_AGENT_MAX_RETRIES` | Maximum retries, default 10; 0 disables retries |
+| `EASY_AGENT_AUTO_MODE_MODEL` | Classifier profile ID |
+| `EASY_AGENT_WEB_SEARCH_BACKEND` | api or bing |
+| `EASY_AGENT_MCP_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MS` | MCP timeout in milliseconds, default 30000 |
+| `EASY_AGENT_SKILL_CHAR_BUDGET` | Skill-list character budget |
+| `EASY_AGENT_TEAMS` | Enable Agent Teams |
+| `EASY_AGENT_DISABLE_HOOKS` | Disable hooks, retaining restrictive merge semantics |
+| `EASY_AGENT_DISABLE_CHECKPOINTING` | Disable file checkpoints |
+| `EASY_AGENT_DISABLE_PROMPT_CACHING` | Disable supported protocol cache fields |
+| `EASY_AGENT_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS` | Disable protocol-specific experimental features |
+| `EASY_AGENT_POWERSHELL` | Windows PowerShell executable |
+| `EASY_AGENT_DEBUG`, `EASY_AGENT_DEBUG_STREAM` | Enable redacted debug output |
+| `VISUAL`, `EDITOR`, `SHELL`, `HOME`, `PROGRAMDATA` | Operating-system conventions keep their names |
+
+Strings are trimmed; blank values are unset. Booleans accept case-insensitive 1/0, true/false, yes/no and on/off. Numbers require complete valid integers; invalid explicit values error without showing secret values. Explicit references may use any variable name; provider variables are not read automatically.
+
